2.  448 bits / 8 bits per byte = 56 bytes.
3.  We can fit this entire entity list into a single `BigInt` (JavaScript supports arbitrary precision integers), and simply pack the bits directly into the `ArrayBuffer` bytes without manual bit-shifting loops.

